  "ruleText": "Diet 403.07 Reinstatement of a Suspended License. A licensee who wishes to reinstate a suspended license shall do so in accordance with Plc 312.04.\n\nSource. #14314, eff 9-9-25, EXPIRES: 9-9-35",
